        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2003/24, Sobe Solid Brass 24\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's 24\" Towel Bar has concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. Constructed out of solid brass. The beautifully contemporary brackets of the Sobe Towel Bar makes it perfect for modern homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2003_24-specifications.gif?v=1704354598\" width=\"600\" height=\"136\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2003/24 24\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-sobe-double-towel-bar-deltana-bbs2006-24\"><b>24\" Sobe Double Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-sobe-towel-bar-deltana-bbs2003-12\"><b>12\" Sobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-sobe-towel-bar-deltana-bbs2002-18\"><b>18\" Sobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/30-inch-sobe-towel-bar-deltana-bbs2004-30\"><b>30\" Sobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe Bath Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 27-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection From Wall to Bar: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2003_24.pdf?v=1691095372\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2003/24 24\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
